{"id": "t173-001", "text": "Femi starts at the new agency on Monday. He sounded a bit nervous about the commute but excited overall. Remind me to text him Monday evening to see how the first day went. He's been at the old place for nearly six years, so it's a big change. His wife Joy is doing the school runs for the first week so he can get in early and make a good impression.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at the new agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous about the commute", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly six years"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t173-003", "text": "Mohammed is retiring at the end of the month after thirty-one years at the council. There's a lunch for him sometime next week, date TBC.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after thirty-one years"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-004", "text": "Call with Kasia. Her daughter Zofia sits her A-level exams in early June and Kasia is more stressed than Zofia is. Zofia wants to study architecture at Sheffield, and her offer depends on getting an A in maths. Kasia says she's revising every evening and hardly leaves her room.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A-level exams", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to study architecture at Sheffield", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "offer depends on getting an A in maths", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}]}
{"id": "t173-009", "text": "Giulia's leaving drinks are off, apparently her manager convinced her to stay another six months. I should ask her how she feels about it when things calm down.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "another six months", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how she feels about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when things calm down", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-010", "text": "Divya is moving to Glasgow in a fortnight for the new role. She's never lived outside London. Remind me to ask Divya for her new address so I can post something. She's renting a two-bed in the West End with a colleague to start with. Her parents are driving up with her stuff the weekend before she starts, and she's having a small goodbye dinner on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Divya for her new address", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "renting a two-bed in the West End", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "colleague", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before she starts", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small goodbye dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t173-013", "text": "Bumped into Kenji at the station. He's just started at a law firm in Canary Wharf and works ridiculous hours. Looks shattered.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at a law firm in Canary Wharf", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works ridiculous hours", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "shattered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-014", "text": "Elijah's interview at the hospital is Thursday afternoon. He's really anxious about the panel part. Text him good luck Wednesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the hospital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious about the panel part", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-015", "text": "Ines and Adebayo finally got the keys to their new place! Housewarming is sometime early next month, they'll confirm.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adebayo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the keys to their new place", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime early next month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-016", "text": "Mia loves rock climbing and has just started bouldering twice a week. Might be a good birthday idea, she mentioned wanting new chalk bags.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "rock climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a week"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting new chalk bags", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t173-017", "text": "Spoke to Mei about her first week as a teacher. It went better than she expected, though the Year 9s are tough. Her mum is visiting from Shanghai in late November. She asked if I knew any good dim sum places near her flat for when her mum arrives. I said I'd think about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first week", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Shanghai", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in late November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t173-022", "text": "Bruno is relocating to Lisbon with work at the start of March. His wife Camila is staying here until the kids finish the school year. Bruno's flying out on the Sunday and coming back every other weekend. Camila is a bit anxious about doing the school runs and her own job on her own for a few months, and their youngest, Leo, has his first nativity play in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "relocating to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the start of March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every other weekend"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious about doing the school runs and her own job on her own", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few months"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "youngest", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first nativity play", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t173-025", "text": "Manon starts her new job at the museum tomorrow. She's been wanting to work there for years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the museum", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "years"}]}
{"id": "t173-027", "text": "Tobi's twins start secondary school in September. He's worried they'll be split up into different forms.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried they'll be split up into different forms", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-029", "text": "Coffee with Femi. His boss is leaving at Christmas and Femi might be asked to step up. He'd be great at it but isn't sure he wants the stress.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "asked to step up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't sure he wants the stress", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t173-032", "text": "Long chat with Kasia tonight. She's finally decided to sell the house in Croydon and move closer to her parents in Kraków, probably over the summer once the sale goes through. She's nervous about the kids changing schools, especially Tomek, who's just settled into his football team. Her brother Piotr is helping with the paperwork. I need to send her that estate agent's number before the weekend and ask her when the leaving do is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sell the house in Croydon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move closer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Kraków", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once the sale goes through", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "changing schools", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomek", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Piotr", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that estate agent's number", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her when the leaving do is", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t173-034", "text": "Alessia has been offered a promotion but it would mean moving to Manchester. She has until next Friday to decide.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alessia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until next Friday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decide", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t173-037", "text": "Divya, or Div as everyone at work calls her, just bought her first flat. It's a one-bed in Hackney, completion sometime in early December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Div", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bought her first flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "one-bed in Hackney", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "completion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early December", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t173-039", "text": "Omar had his final day at the bank yesterday after twelve years. Leaving drinks went late. He starts the new role with the startup in a fortnight. He's moving across from retail banking into product, which he's wanted for ages. He asked me to keep the twenty-second free for a proper celebration dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final day at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after twelve years"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role with the startup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "ages"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the twenty-second", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebration dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t173-042", "text": "Ines is a vegetarian and doesn't drink, so keep that in mind for the dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keep that in mind for the dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t173-043", "text": "Adebayo Okafor has his PhD viva on Tuesday. He's been preparing for months and says he can't sleep. Must message him the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adebayo Okafor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD viva", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "months"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t173-047", "text": "Quick call with Dong. He said his mum is having her knee replaced sometime next week and he'll be staying with her for a bit afterwards. Remind me to check how she's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her knee replaced", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how she's getting on", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t173-049", "text": "Obi's mum is moving into sheltered housing on Thursday. He's taking the day off to help. It's been a hard few months for the family.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving into sheltered housing", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hard few months", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t173-052", "text": "Rory's moving to Berlin in early April for a two-year contract. He's learning German on Duolingo every morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rory", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Berlin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "two-year contract", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning German", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning"}]}
{"id": "t173-060", "text": "Dinner with Esther and her partner Ade on Saturday. Esther told me her brother Sam is finally moving back from Toronto in late January, and their parents are throwing a welcome home party for him the weekend after he lands. She also mentioned her niece starts nursery in the new year. Don't forget to ask Esther what Sam's into, so I can bring a small present to the party.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ade", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back from Toronto", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in late January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "welcome home party", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after he lands", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Esther what Sam's into", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
